-- words --
2c all held: every row has a holder of the kind its tag needs, so the check prints nothing and exits 0.
-- input/body.md --
| Item | Tag | Holder |
|---|---|---|
| demo-I1 | Open | owner: "yes, keep it" |
| demo-I2 | Fact | F-ABC123 |
| demo-I3 | Proposed | close: "dropped, the owner does not want it" |
-- run --
python3 skills/hyp-grill/scripts/check_holders.py "$HYP_EXAMPLE/input/body.md"
echo "exit code: $?"
-- floor: equals --
exit code: 0
